":"ikura-8b8"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"说心里话，我认为是不可能通过的。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-8f1","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-8f1"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"初中时代的出席日数不足自然是不用说，而且作为学校这个组织来说也不愿意接受有特殊情况的学生，更不用说是像加奈这样的了","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-960","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-960"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"作为哥哥的我看来，夜校也好技校也好，只要是能学到点什么的地方就可以了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-9ac","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-9ac"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"但是，她本人希望升学。而且那已然是从平常的加奈看来让人不可相信般的强烈的意志和热情。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a04","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a04"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"就这样，加奈参加了我的母校双叶学园的中考。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-a60","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-a60"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"embedded-in-text","baseline":{"text":"「……说起来，为什么非要选双叶呢。校舍陈旧，教师思想古旧顽固，而且教学硬件也不齐全……」","speaker":"隆道"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-aca","target":{"variantId":"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja","sectionId":"main","eventId":"ikura-aca"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"在那里上了三年学的切身感想。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"paired/kana-okaeri/ev11/zh-ja\",\"main\"]/ikura-aff","targ